WEBVTT

00:18:28.274 --> 00:18:30.857
(WorkLife theme music)

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:37.856
AG: OK, this is going to be
a different kind of ad.

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:41.196
I've played a personal role
in selecting the sponsors for this podcast

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.897
because they all have
interesting cultures of their own.

00:18:43.921 --> 00:18:46.898
Today, we're going inside
the workplace at Accenture.

00:18:47.991 --> 00:18:49.540
(Musical interlude)